{"id":"7941928358a8428484533ea48651138b","model":"gpt-oss-120b","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"answer\": \"The Rescuers was released earlier.\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    [\"The Rescuers Down Under\", 1],\n    [\"The Muppets (soundtrack)\", 0]\n  ]\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to answer: Which Walt Disney film was released earlier, The Rescuers or The Muppets? Use evidence. We have evidence about The Rescuers Down Under (1990) and The Rescuers (1977) mentioned in Disney Renaissance list. Also The Muppets soundtrack released 2011, but the film \"The Muppets\" is a musical comedy film; release date not given directly but soundtrack release date is November 22, 2011, implying film around that time. The Rescuers (1977) is earlier than 2011. So answer: The Rescuers was released earlier.\n\nNeed citations: evidence showing The Rescuers release year 1977. In Disney Renaissance list: sentence 1 includes \"The Rescuers Down Under\" (1990) but also earlier list includes \"The Rescuers Down Under\" not The Rescuers. However earlier line: \"The 29th Disney animated feature film, the film is the sequel to the 1977 animated film 'The Rescuers'\". That indicates The Rescuers 1977. So we can cite that sentence (sentence_id 1 from The Rescuers Down Under). Also maybe other evidence: Eva Gabor voiced Miss Bianca in Disney’s \"The Rescuers\" and \"The Rescuers Down Under\". That doesn't give date. But we have the Disney Renaissance list includes \"The Rescuers Down Under\" (1990) but not The Rescuers. However we can still use the first evidence: \"The Rescuers Down Under is a 1990 ... sequel to the 1977 animated film 'The Rescuers'\". That gives year 1977 for The Rescuers. For The Muppets, we have soundtrack release 2011, but not film release date. However we can infer film release around 2011. Use that as citation: \"The Muppets: An Original Walt Disney Records Soundtrack ... released ... November 22, 2011 for the musical comedy film 'The Muppets'.\" That indicates film around 2011. So we can cite that.\n\nThus answer: The Rescuers was released earlier.\n\nProvide JSON with answer and citations list.\n\nCitations: need title and zero-based sentence index. For The Rescuers: title \"The Rescuers Down Under\", sentence_id 1. For The Muppets: title \"The Muppets (soundtrack)\", sentence_id 0.\n\nReturn JSON."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1626,"completion_tokens":575,"total_tokens":2201,"audio_prompt_tokens":0},"created":1791981911,"object":"chat.completion","prompt_filter_results":null}